{
  "id": "hello-hcl",
  "name": "Hello HCL",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "HyaLab",
  "description": "可安装的示例插件：展示声明式页面、列表、提示块与受控动作。",
  "minLauncherVersion": "0.1.0",
  "permissions": ["openUrl"],
  "contributes": {
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "hello",
        "title": "Hello HCL",
        "icon": "auto_awesome",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "text": "欢迎使用 Hydrogen Chloride Launcher"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "这个页面完全由 plugin.json 中的声明式组件渲染。启动器不会执行插件代码，也不会把账户、库或文件系统暴露给插件。"
          },
          {
            "type": "divider"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "插件目录：plugins/hello-hcl/",
              "清单文件：plugin.json",
              "动作需要声明对应权限",
              "页面组件由启动器统一渲染"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "info",
            "text": "Alpha 只支持声明式页面。动态代码、文件读写和网络请求留待后续的沙箱宿主。"
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "text": "flutter run -d linux"
          },
          {
            "type": "row",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "button",
                "label": "查看 GitHub",
                "action": {
                  "type": "openUrl",
                  "url": "https://github.com/HyaLab/HydrogenChlorideLauncher"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "button",
                "label": "打开插件管理",
                "action": {
                  "type": "openSettings",
                  "section": "plugins"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "button",
                "label": "显示消息",
                "action": {
                  "type": "showMessage",
                  "text": "这是由插件按钮触发的启动器消息。"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
